import json,re,sys
from pathlib import Path
root=Path(sys.argv[1]);data={}
CASES={
 'animal':('A Slay Animal weapon against an animal',
  'A level thirty-one warrior wields a Broad Sword carrying the animals slay, with a lit torch in the later light slot, and faces an adjacent white harpy. The original assigns the slay traits per equipment slot instead of accumulating them, so the weaponless light slot erases the weapon slays: the Borg values the thrust as if the weapon slew nothing. The correction accumulates slays across slots and the weapon counts.'),
 'kill-undead':('A *Slay Undead* weapon against a zombified orc (kill trait)',
  'The same warrior wields a Broad Sword carrying the race-destroying undead slay (multiplier five) and faces an adjacent zombified orc. The original never sets the kill traits from equipment and also loses the plain slay to the later light slot, so the thrust is valued as if the weapon slew nothing. The correction accumulates the slay and sets the kill trait, so the five-times value applies.'),
 'nonanimal':('Control: the same weapon against a small kobold',
  'The same warrior and weapon face a small kobold, which carries no animal flag. The slay cannot apply, all three readings coincide, and the complete log is byte-identical before and after the correction: the fix changes only the animal case.')}
for mode,(label,explanation) in CASES.items():
 item={'label':label,'explanation':explanation}
 for phase in ('before','after'):
  raw=(root/f'{phase}-{mode}.log').read_text()
  entry={'raw':raw,'passed':'native-c/slay-239 finished: 1/1 passed' in raw}
  for tag in ('TRAIT ','RATING ','OUTCOME '):
   match=re.search(re.escape(tag)+r'(.*)',raw)
   entry[tag.split()[0].lower()]=match[1].strip() if match else None
  item[phase]=entry
 data[mode]=item
html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>The weapon whose slays vanished</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f4f1ea;color:#253a3c;font:18px/1.6 system-ui}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:32px 24px}h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.2}h2{font-size:24px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd6d0;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}.cards .card{border-top:6px solid #648e80}.num{font-size:34px;font-weight:750}select,button{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #aabdb5;border-radius:7px;background:white}button{cursor:pointer;margin:14px 8px 0 0}button.active{background:#24685d;color:white}.summary{background:#e6eee6;padding:20px;border-left:5px solid #377367}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:13px/1.5 monospace;max-height:330px;overflow:auto}details{background:white;padding:20px;margin:20px 0}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:650px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:30px}}</style><main><p>Recorded native thrust valuations</p><h1>The Borg forgot what its weapon could slay</h1><p>The slay traits were assigned, not accumulated, for every equipment slot in the Borgs inventory scan. The last occupied slot - usually the light or the boots, which carry no slays - therefore erased whatever the wielded weapon provided, and every melee valuation saw an unslaying weapon. A Slay Animal blade was rated exactly like a plain one.</p><section class="card"><label for="scenario">Choose a recorded situation</label><br><select id="scenario"></select><p id="explanation"></p><br><button data-step="0">Thrust value</button></section><div class="cards"><section id="original" class="card"><h2>Original</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p></section><section id="compared" class="card"><h2>Corrected</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p></section></div><p class="summary" id="outcome"></p><h2>What the control establishes</h2><p>Against a small kobold, which carries no animal flag, all three readings coincide and the complete log is byte-identical before and after: the correction changes only the case where the slay applies. The forced-on reading (the same attack with the slay trait set by hand) is identical in both variants, so the correction restores exactly the value the slay is worth.</p><details><summary>Experiment conditions and limits</summary><p>Native Human Warrior level thirty-one, depth five, seed one thousand, lit constructed arena, a Broad Sword carrying the animals slay from the slay table (race flag ANIMAL, the base multiplier of two) wielded in the weapon slot, the birth torches wielded in the later light slot, an adjacent awake white harpy (or small kobold in the control). The measurement calls the public thrust valuation with the slay trait as the inventory scan computed it, then with the trait forced off and on. This isolates the trait accumulation, not full autonomous play. No death or survival claim.</p></details><details><summary>Recorded native output</summary><h3>Original</h3><pre id="original-log"></pre><h3>Corrected</h3><pre id="compared-log"></pre></details><p>Canonical report: <a href="https://github.com/diegoami/neo-angband-tracker/issues/239">issue239</a>.</p></main><script>
const data=__DATA__;const select=document.getElementById('scenario');for(const [key,c] of Object.entries(data)){let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=key;o.textContent=c.label;select.append(o)}function draw(){let c=data[select.value];document.getElementById('explanation').textContent=c.explanation;for(const [panel,phase] of [['original','before'],['compared','after']]){let d=c[phase],p=document.getElementById(panel);let r=d.rating||'';let m=r.match(/auto=(-?\\d+)/);p.querySelector('.num').textContent='Thrust value: '+(m?m[1]:'n/a');p.querySelector('.state').textContent=d.outcome||'';document.getElementById(panel+'-log').textContent=d.raw}document.getElementById('outcome').textContent=select.value==='kill-undead'?('Kill trait as computed: original '+(c.before.trait||'')+'; corrected '+(c.after.trait||'')+'. Thrust value original '+((c.before.rating||'').match(/auto=(-?\\d+)/)||[0,'n/a'])[1]+', corrected '+((c.after.rating||'').match(/auto=(-?\\d+)/)||[0,'n/a'])[1]+'.'):select.value==='animal'?'The original values the Slay Animal weapon at 17 against a white harpy - the same as without the slay; the correction values it at 20, exactly the forced-on reading.':'The kobold carries no animal flag: 19 either way, and the logs match byte for byte.';}select.addEventListener('change',draw);draw();</script></html>'''
(root/'replay.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(data).replace('<','\\u003c')))
(root/'replay-data.json').write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2)+'\n')
print('Open in your browser:',root/'replay.html')
